<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Pakistan score 181 for nine v Australia.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Pakistan score 181 for nine v Australia.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 181 for nine in 50 overs against Australia in their limited overs World Series match at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Thursday.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 181 for nine in 50 overs (Inzamam-ul-Haq 64, Anthony Stuart five for 26) v Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
